msgid "Slide blocks to solve the puzzle"
msgstr "移動方塊解開圍困的方塊遊戲"

#: data/org.gnome.Klotski.appdata.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"GNOME Klotski is a set of block sliding puzzles. The objective is to move "
"the patterned block to the area bordered by green markers. To do so, you’ll "
"need to slide other blocks out of the way. Complete each puzzle in as few "
"moves as possible!"
msgstr ""
"GNOME "
"華容道是一組方塊滑動謎題。目標是將有圖案的方塊移動到有綠色標記圍位的區域。要做到這點，您需要將路徑上其他的方塊移走。儘可能以最少步數完成每個謎題！"

#: data/org.gnome.Klotski.appdata.xml.in:16
msgid ""
"GNOME Klotski comes with nearly thirty different puzzle layouts of varying "
"difficulty. Some of the layouts are similar and only the size of one or more "
"blocks differ. Other layouts have more variety."
msgstr "GNOME 華容道內含近三十種不同難度的謎題配置。其中部分配置是類似的，差別只有一或多個方塊不同。其他配置會有更多的變化。"

